  "body": "Direct-PR: daily refresh of the README milestone table, under the operator's standing authorization (docs only, self-merged when CI is green).\n\nThe problem: the \"Lots done\" column was dated 2026-11-03 and M1 showed 39 of 41.\n\nWhat changed: the date and the M1 count (40 of 41), taken from the daily board render (`tooling/roadmap`). Nothing else.\n\nTests: docs only, no code.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_014QH2CEBkjmFApUaMrewUvD)_\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n<!-- coderabbit-ai-generated:v1 -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Documentation**\n  * Updated the M1 progress date to November 5, 2026, and the completed-lot count to 40 of 41.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->",
